    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/aba0b4b97c24e4846c78b5d79ca73896.poster.avif?t=1749744299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/aba0b4b97c24e4846c78b5d79ca73896.webm?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/aba0b4b97c24e4846c78b5d79ca73896.mp4?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Ascension is a fast-paced, action packed roguelite game. Choose your hero from a diverse roster, each with unique abilities, weapons, and playstyles. As you battle through hordes of enemies, you'll collect powerful gears, unlock new abilities, and face off against bosses that threaten to end your journey. Every run is different, no two battles are alike as you craft your own strategy for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay hordes of monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick 20 minute runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer the map and find other points of interest that will aid in your survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character from several playable classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience gems, level up and choose skills from diverse pool of upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Acquire gears to strengthen your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/56dd5d8f893e373a99c72477c9ad7bb9.poster.avif?t=1749744299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/56dd5d8f893e373a99c72477c9ad7bb9.webm?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/56dd5d8f893e373a99c72477c9ad7bb9.mp4?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/aba0b4b97c24e4846c78b5d79ca73896.poster.avif?t=1749744299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/aba0b4b97c24e4846c78b5d79ca73896.webm?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/aba0b4b97c24e4846c78b5d79ca73896.mp4?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Ascension is a fast-paced, action packed roguelite game. Choose your hero from a diverse roster, each with unique abilities, weapons, and playstyles. As you battle through hordes of enemies, you'll collect powerful gears, unlock new abilities, and face off against bosses that threaten to end your journey. Every run is different, no two battles are alike as you craft your own strategy for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay hordes of monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick 20 minute runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer the map and find other points of interest that will aid in your survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character from several playable classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect experience gems, level up and choose skills from diverse pool of upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Acquire gears to strengthen your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/56dd5d8f893e373a99c72477c9ad7bb9.poster.avif?t=1749744299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/56dd5d8f893e373a99c72477c9ad7bb9.webm?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420820/extras/56dd5d8f893e373a99c72477c9ad7bb9.mp4?t=1749744299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Survive relentless waves of monsters in this fast paced roguelite action game. Choose your hero, defeat epic bosses, and unlock powerful upgrades in a dark, procedurally generated world.",
